  message: "Dogfood tranche 05 reproduction (F91.A2 / anon-card-002): TRUE-DUPLICATE confirmation on frozen substrate. For 110276/110533 edges quality.score == confidence exactly; the remaining 257 — ALL type=dispatches_to, evidence_type=type_hierarchy, quality.reason=low_confidence_fallback — have quality.score == round(confidence,3) != confidence (e.g. confidence=0.3470110468942836 vs quality.score=0.347). One producer (the type-hierarchy linker) rounds its score to 3 decimals while every other producer copies confidence verbatim. A consumer comparing edge.confidence to edge.quality.score for equality finds 257 false mismatches; a consumer trusting quality.score as authoritative confidence loses precision. (exact:110276 / rounded_match:257 / neither:0.) Blind severity 2/5, reproduced on frozen substrate."  # 99ae
