  message: "Re-confirmed quality.score==confidence on a full behavior map (TRUE_DUPLICATE; blind-severity-derived priority signal: P2). quality.score == confidence verbatim on 110276/110533 edges; the remaining 257 differ only by round(confidence,3) and are all the type-hierarchy / type_hierarchy / low_confidence_fallback bucket. So quality.score carries no signal distinct from confidence — a consumer reading it expecting an independent quality metric gets the same number back, and combining the two double-counts one value."  # c7c2
